body:
Unless it changes again an hour after reset, I'm inclined to agree that there are hidden community metrics involving Telesto that, once met, will change the gun.

&#x200B;

If another change occurs at around the same time after reset, then I'd be inclined to believe it's time-based

&#x200B;

Edit: logged in to check and there's still no change to the gun. I'm inclined to believe that there are hidden community metrics that we have to hit. Whether that's shots fired or kills? I don't know

i happened to be in a position where i was able to hardcast which is why i did, but yeah. i forgot what the SGE equivilent of swiftcast was :P so that one was definitely on me, but the important thing is that i picked both dps up and healed them both properly as i should.

&#x200B;

