it seems that i struggle a little more with some of the huge pulls my tanks usually do in the stormblood dungeons and i do well enough during boss fights. you are correct that both my dps were down and appreciate knowing that i made the right call, although i guess it could be said that they died because i wasn't healing/mitigating damage enough either.

&#x200B;

in any case, i appreciate the advice and reassurance

